{"product_id":"the-mansions-of-the-gods","title":"The Mansions Of The Gods","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Mansions of the Gods is the seventeenth volume of the Asterix comic book series, by René Goscinny (stories) and Albert Uderzo (illustrations).\u003cbr\u003eCaesar tries to dilute solidarity and weaken local customs in Gaul by creating a vacation resort near the Village. The villagers sabotage the efforts, first by magically replanting the forest as soon as it's cut, and by creating a slaves' union; later by being obnoxious neighbors to the resident Romans.\u003cbr\u003eDimensions: 216 x 298\u003cbr\u003eAuthor: René Goscinny | Albert Uderzo\u003cbr\u003eISBN: 9780340192696\u003cbr\u003eFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003ePages: 48\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45645712261273,"sku":"1RE9780340192696","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/Mansions-3.jpg?v=1755282395","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-mansions-of-the-gods","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}